  "summary_en": "Technical robotics paper modelling human-robot interaction as a two-player Markov game and using potential-based reward shaping to increase human trust in robots while bounding task performance loss. Evaluated in a simulated search-and-rescue scenario. Contains no regulatory or governance content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
